    "summary": "- Invite tokens are 32 random bytes from crypto/rand, in unpadded base64url (43 characters), and only their SHA-256 hash is stored. The token appears only in the invitation email. No POST or GET answer and no snapshot contains it.\n- Accepting returns 404 `invite_not_found` for unknown or revoked tokens, 410 `invite_used` once accepted, and 410 `invite_expired` after 7 days on the service clock. Re-inviting an address (case-insensitive) revokes the older invite. GET lists only pending invites, each with `expires_at`.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass, and the new tests\n...[truncated]",
